 D17:4)\n\nDave: Yeah, it's great! It feels really good to make a difference and see their relief when their car is fixed. Makes me proud!\n[S17T5] (dia_id: D17:5)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave, that's awesome! You should be really proud of yourself for bringing joy to others. I booked a flight ticket to Boston last week! I'm so excited about my upcoming trip to Boston. Look at this! See you soon, buddy!\n[Image caption: a photo of a book with a boarding pass and a boarding pass]\n[S17T6] (dia_id: D17:6)","text_sha256":"fb5c39a282853184e88c76df2577d2fd81e32f2ab46ffc6537fb7e5a0168f4cb","timestamp":"2023-09-02T09:19:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":586,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":13158,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":13744},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"Where did Dave return from with new knowledge of different techniques of car restoration?","question_id":"conv-50-q033","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-main40-v1","run_position":29,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"8d94903003bce75ecd10b18039506c9fa48574514ac7c8c551efc8c18a6856d5","runtime_contr